":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T01:04:43-07:00","id":1384122,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1383997-2e-fan-lodge-of-scrolls#post1383997\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:18px\">The Sacred Hunt</span></b><br /> The Lodge Sacred Hunt grants your characters the ability to sense if human ( or humanoid ) has esoteric lore that is not known to Old Knowledge. Lore is shown as inner light, more intense as being have more exotic lore. When the Hunt is finalized, adherent can get knowledge from the Prey by touching it, similar how general <i>Siskur-Dah</i> let participants to get Essence from targeted spirit.[/LIST]</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, Uratha get essence by eating the spirit, not merely touching it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26112-excess","name":"Excess","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"271"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T20:13:52-07:00","id":1384346,"title":"","content":"Added Scribes to adherents titles, as was in <b>The Pack</b> book.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Excess</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1383997-2e-fan-lodge-of-scrolls?p=1384122#post1384122\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, Uratha get essence by eating the spirit, not merely touching it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I stand corrected. Then Scrolls-Keeper need to make unarmed attack to touch the victim before stealing lore. Rewritten correct rules piece on Sacred Hunt section.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1383997-2e-fan-lodge-of-scrolls#post1383997\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18px\">The Sacred Hunt</span></b><br /> The Lodge Sacred Hunt grants your characters the ability to sense if human ( or humanoid ) has esoteric lore that is not known to Old Knowledge. Lore is shown as inner light, more intense as being have more exotic lore. When the Hunt is finalized, adherent can get knowledge from the Prey by touching it, similar how general Siskur-Dah let participants to get Essence from targeted spirit, only that adherent need to make unarmed touch attack by rolling Strength or Dexterity + Brawl \u2013 Defense of the prey. One touch at the end of the Hunt is all that is needed to steal knowledge from prey, instead of devouring it.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-27-2020, 11:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}